# ============================================================
# NOT included on purpose: the old seyori.name.ng panel's GITHUB_TOKEN /
# ADMIN_KEY / TUNNEL_TOKEN from earlier in this project. That
# infrastructure was dropped, those secrets were already flagged as
# exposed back when they were shared, and they have no bearing on this
# new panel — carrying stale secrets into a fresh deployment is more
# risk than help.
#
# server.js (the separate web panel) isn't included in this build's
# active path — it still needs sessionManager.js, which hasn't been
# built. telegramPairBot.js doesn't touch Pterodactyl's API at all; it
# runs bot.js directly as a local process via instanceManager.js. So
# nothing panel-specific (API key, node ID, egg ID) is needed here
# regardless of which panel this runs on.
# ============================================================
